    <string name="purge_title">Erasing old versions</string>
    <string name="purge_hint">When you edit or delete an entry written in an earlier session, its old version is erased in place. Someone who has two copies of the file taken at different times and the password of another vault can notice that an old block changed. In manual mode old versions stay encrypted in the file until you erase them; anyone with this vault\'s password could still read them with their own tools.</string>
    <string name="purge_manual">Erase old versions manually</string>
